Domain Entity GraduationPlan
    documentation 'This entity is a plan outlining the required credits, credits by subject,
                  'credits by course, and other criteria required for graduation. A graduation plan 
                  'may be one or more standard plans defined by an education organization and/or 
                  'individual plans for some or all students.
    descriptor GraduationPlanType
        documentation 'The type of academic plan the student is following for graduation: for example, 
                      'Minimum, Recommended, Distinguished, or Standard.
        is part of identity
    bool IndividualPlan
        documentation 'An indicator of whether the GraduationPlan is tailored for an individual.
        is optional
    include Credits
        documentation 'The total number of credits required for graduation under this plan.
        is required
        with context TotalRequired
    include CreditsBySubject
        documentation 'The total credits required in subject to graduate. Only those courses 
                      'identified as a high school course requirement are eligible to meet subject 
                      'credit requirements.
        is optional collection
    include CreditsByCourse
        documentation 'The total credits required for graduation by taking a specific course, or 
                      'by taking one or more from a set of courses.
        is optional collection
    reference EducationOrganization
        documentation 'The reference to the EducationOrganization defining the plan.
        is part of identity
    enumeration SchoolYear
        documentation 'The school year the student is expected to graduate.
        is part of identity
        with context Graduation
    include RequiredAssessment
        documentation 'The assessments and associated required score and performance level needed to satisfy graduation requirements.
        is optional collection